        "original_id": "873bda1f-54ff-5eb7-9010-e35737592c33",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: David Lightfoot, Ivan Milat, Bradley Murdoch, Rupert Glasson\n- Films: Wolf Creek, Rogue, Coffin Rock\n- Topics: horror films, film marketing, true-crime inspirations\n\nFacts:\n- In the 1990s, Ivan Milat committed real-life murders of tourists that later echoed elements of the plot of Wolf Creek.\n- In 2001, Bradley Murdoch committed a real-life murder case that later echoed elements of the plot of Wolf Creek.\n- Wolf Creek was ambiguously marketed as being based on true events.\n- David Lightfoot worked on the horror films Wolf Creek and Rogue.\n- Coffin Rock is an Australian melodramatic thriller film directed by Rupert Glasson.\n- Coffin Rock was produced by David Lightfoot.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
